<p>Mar gayi hia binte shaahe karbala zindaan me<br />
ro rahe hai ahlebaite mustafa zindaan me</p>

<p>boli baano lut gayi mai karbala me ya khuda<br />
Kis tarah ho dafn ka saamaa'n bhala zindaan me</p>

<p>Bekasi ghurbat yateemi aur aseeri haye haye<br />
Sar jhukaae baithe hai zainulleba zindaan me</p>

<p>Khaak par mayyat padi hai dukhtare shabbir ki<br />
Karbala ka hoobahu hai waaqeya zindaan me</p>

<p>Roz o shab ghut ghut ke aaqir daste zulme shimr se<br />
Ki yateeme shaah ne aaqir qaza zindaan me</p>

<p>Peeto sar ahle azaa pursa do binte shaah ka<br />
qaak udhaate hai aale aba zindaan me<br />
</p>